  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Your 30A Escape Starts Here in Seagrove 🌴✨<br><br>**GOLF CART IS AVAILABLE FOR RENT FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE AT $100 PER DAY.**<br><br>Welcome to your new favorite beach house—where flip-flops are the dress code, pool days turn into late-night laughs, and Seagrove’s best spots are just a stroll or quick ride away. This newly remodeled retreat puts you right in the heart of 30A, close to sugar-white sands, emerald waters, and everything you love about the coast.<br><br>Why You’ll Love This Home<br><br>🌊 Location, Location, Vacation<br>Stay in beautiful Seagrove, just moments from beach access, dining, shopping, and all the fun of 30A. Park the car and slip straight into vacation mode.<br><br>🏊‍♀️ Private Pool Paradise<br>Your own large, fenced-in private pool is the star of the show—perfect for laid-back days, splash contests, and floats with a cold drink in hand.<br><br>Pool can be heated for $80/day with 24-hour notice.<br><br>🛋 Fresh, Open & Inviting Living Space<br>Step into a newly remodeled downstairs with an easy, open layout made for together time.<br><br>Comfy seating for the whole crew<br><br>Big flat-screen TV for movie nights, game days, and lazy evenings in<br><br>🍳 Fully Stocked Kitchen & Outdoor Grill<br>Cook, laugh, and linger together in the stylish, fully equipped kitchen.<br><br>Modern appliances, plenty of prep space, and everything you need to dine in<br><br>Fire up the charcoal grill and enjoy al fresco dinners by the pool under the evening sky<br><br>Room to Relax – Sleeps the Whole Crew<br><br>First Floor:<br><br>🛏 King Bedroom – Comfortable and convenient, just steps from the action<br><br>🛏 Bunk Room – Two twin-over-full bunk beds (sleeps 6) – the kids’ instant favorite hangout<br><br>Second Floor:<br><br>🛏 Master Suite with King Bed – Your private retreat with space to unwind after a sun-soaked day<br><br>🛏 Queen Bedroom – Cozy and calm, perfect for recharging<br><br>Outdoor Fun & Chill Vibes<br><br>Spend the day playing Marco Polo, treasure diving, or simply floating in your private pool<br><br>Take a short stroll over to the community pool on Sand Dollar Ct. for a change of scenery<br><br>Kick back on one of the serene balconies with a morning coffee or an evening drink and a good book<br><br>Bring the Pup 🐾<br><br>We’re pet-friendly!<br><br>Up to two dogs under 25 lbs welcome<br><br>$350 non-refundable pet fee<br><br>Booking Details<br><br>Cancellation Policy:<br><br>Full refund for cancellations 30+ days before arrival<br><br>No refunds for cancellations within 30 days of arrival<br><br>Payment:<br><br>50% deposit due at booking<br><br>Remaining balance due 30 days prior to check-in<br><br>Check-In / Check-Out:<br><br>Check-in: 4:00 PM CST<br><br>Check-out: 10:00 AM CST<br><br>Age Requirement:<br><br>Must be 25+ to book, with at least 1 adult for every 2 guests under 25<br><br>Extra Perks<br><br>High-speed WiFi to keep everyone connected<br><br>Prime Seagrove location near top 30A beaches, restaurants, and shops<br><br>From sunrise walks on the beach to sunset swims in your private pool, this Seagrove home is designed for easy, unforgettable days on 30A.<br><br>Ready to make some memories?<br>Book your stay today—your Seagrove escape is waiting. 🌴🩴✨",
